Package: com.t4mag0.sevenfold
Name: Sevenfold
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Description: Automatic app signing.
 Sevenfold automates the signing of your sideloaded apps using your personal
 Apple ID. Keep your apps signed with scheduled automatic renewals,
 configurable conditions, and background signing—even while your device is
 locked.
 .
 Features
  • Automatic Signing — Schedule signing tasks with configurable Wi-Fi,
    charging, and retry options.
  • Batch Signing — Sign up to three apps simultaneously.
  • Direct IPA Installation — Install .ipa files directly through Sevenfold.
  • App ID Tracking — Monitor App ID usage for free Apple ID accounts.
  • Shared Certificate — Use a single signing certificate across your devices.
  • Server Fallback — Automatic fallback to an alternative sign-in server
    when needed.
  • Multilingual Support — Available in nine languages.
  • Native iPad Support — Optimized interface designed for iPad.
 .
 Requirements
  • iOS 15 or later
  • Rootless or RootHide jailbreak
Section: Applications
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), uikittools
